# Transcribed from Movy's browser-test/logic/automation.mjs at 9190e79
# (github.com/DimaDake/schwung-movy, MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 megadake;
# engines/third_party/movy/LICENSE) to the FM-1's panel (docs/15 S8).
# Its SP-35 check: a parameter that cannot be locked (Macro's Model,
# NOLOCK) under a held step takes the turn, says so ("Model" / "cannot be
# locked") and writes no lock; with no step held the knob turns it on the
# sound, as ever.
--button 0.05:SEQ
--key 0.10:7:100:0.5
--turn 0.20:SELECT:1
--turn 0.25:SELECT:1
--turn 0.30:KNOB1:1
--turn 0.80:KNOB1:1
--button 1.00:PLAY/STOP
